# npm proxy — optional. Prefer HTTP_PROXY / HTTPS_PROXY in repo-root .env (see docs/PROXY.md).
# Copied to .npmrc on first ./dev.sh when missing; proxy lines are filled when HTTP_PROXY is set.
#
# proxy=http://proxy.corp.example:8080
# https-proxy=http://proxy.corp.example:8080
# noproxy=localhost,127.0.0.1
